Class StorageService:
- centralize reads from local files or S3-compatible object storage
- choose backend based on root prefix or GAME_DATA_SOURCE

Function read_json_from_root:
- read and parse JSON from one root + relative path

Function read_optional_json_from_root:
- return None instead of raising when a localization asset is missing

Function read_text_from_root:
- dispatch to local or S3 read path

Function _should_use_s3:
- decide if the requested root should be resolved through object storage

Function _read_text_from_local:
- resolve repo-relative or absolute filesystem paths

Function _read_text_from_s3:
- fetch object text from the configured S3 bucket

Property s3_client:
- lazily construct the boto3 client on first S3 access
